Rule 11 (when subscripts is "bij,bjk->bik", operand tensor must be 3D with positive batch dimension)
{v_1 : str, v_2 : tensor} |= if v_1 = "bij,bjk->bik" then ndim(v_2) = 3 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) > 0
