Rule 12 (when subscripts is "ii->i", operand tensor must be 2D with matching dimensions)
{v_1 : str, v_2 : tensor} |= if v_1 = "ii->i" then ndim(v_2) = 2 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = shape(v_2, 1)
