Rule 13 (when subscripts is "i,j->ij", operand tensor must be 1D with positive length)
{v_1 : str, v_2 : tensor} |= if v_1 = "i,j->ij" then ndim(v_2) = 1 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) > 0
